    "revision": 1,
    "title": "Write a practical message",
    "subtitle": "The evidence changes the answer · 1",
    "context": "Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to compare a claim with evidence and revise a conclusion.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U3-22-required-composition-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Compose a purposeful message",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U3-22-required-composition-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "written",
            "prompt": "The evidence changes the answer · 1: Write a practical explanation for someone joining the situation late. State the problem, a supported reason or constraint, and a clear proposed next step.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "我在学校门口等车，看见一辆车上写着三。我准备上车，朋友让我先等一等，看看车要去哪里。我说昨天坐的也是三，应该没有问题。\n\n朋友说学校两边都有这个号码的车，一边往东，一边往西。我们要去东边的医院，昨天从医院回学校，坐的是往西走的车。\n\n我问司机，车是不是去东边的医院。他说这辆往西走，让我们过马路，到东边等。我才知道，号码一样，去的方向不一样。\n\n我们过了马路，再看站在路边的人等什么车。三路车来了，我又问了一次，司机说去医院。这次我们才上车，没有因为号码对就马上上。\n\n到了医院，我说下次不只记号码，还要记自己从哪里到哪里。朋友说，不同的事可能有一样的号码，比如去和回，要把号码和方向一起看。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Write your own message",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed writing practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "The problem, constraint and next step connect coherently."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "I distinguished the source facts from my proposal."
              }
            ],
            "minLength": 1
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
    ],
